  description: You can reveal 1 "Power Patron" monster in your Extra Deck; banish
    (face-down) 1 card from your hand, then add to your hand or Special Summon, 1
    monster from your Deck that mentions that revealed monster's name (except in
    its once-per-turn restriction clause). You can only use this effect of "Plundered
    Power Patron Plane - Vidolia" once per turn. Monsters your opponent controls
    lose 100 ATK for each banished card. Your opponent cannot activate the effects
    of cards in the GY, while you control "Nerva the Power Patron of Creation", "Jupiter
    the Power Patron of Destruction", and "Junora the Power Patron of Tuning".
